    "id": "political-corruption-throughout-the-world",
    "title": "Political corruption throughout the world!",
    "date_iso": "2019-01-26",
    "date_str": "January 26, 2019",
    "original_url": "https://dohyungchoi.wordpress.com/2019/01/26/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/",
    "thumb": "assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/thumb.jpg",
    "fig_count": 7,
    "excerpt": "Corruption is a big problem throughout the world. A lot of countries and companies suffer due to corruption, and it is one of the biggest improvements that we all need to establish to make the world a better place. Today...",
    "word_count": 452,
    "read_time_min": 3,
    "html": "<p>Corruption is a big problem throughout the world. A lot of countries and companies suffer due to corruption, and it is one of the biggest improvements that we all need to establish to make the world a better place. Today&#8217;s article is about corruption index throughout different countries and regions. Since the dataset was quite simple and had corruption index for different countries from 2012 to 2016, I based my analysis solely on data from 2016 because there has been almost no change on the data from 2012 to 2016 as time passed. We will look at how each regions of the world are corrupt in average, and the top 5 countries in the world that are the most anti-corrupt. Then we will dive little more into the regional data, to see the top 5 most anti-corrupt countries in the particular region to gain some deeper understanding.</p>\n<p>How to read the index: The higher the index, the less-corrupt a country is!</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-211\" src=\"assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/fig_1.png\" alt=\"screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.27.11 pm\" /></p>\n<p>The above graph shows the regional average for the corruption index. As we can see, Europe and Central Asia are the least corrupt regions in the world, followed by Americas, and the most corrupt region is Sub-Saharan African region.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-212\" src=\"assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/fig_2.png\" alt=\"screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.27.24 pm\" /></p>\n<p>The above graph is shows the top 5 least corrupt countries in the World. Apart from New Zealand, we can see that the other 4 are all European countries, especially the Northern European countries. All these top 5 countries also have the highest GDP per capita in the world. My hypothesis is that the higher the GDP per capita, the lower the corruption since people have less motivation to abuse the laws and regulations to attain goods and services. It would be interesting to see more detail if there is a dataset.</p>\n<p>Let&#8217;s move onto little more detail, with the regional analysis.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-213\" src=\"assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/fig_3.png\" alt=\"screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.28.27 pm\" /></p>\n<p>The above graph shows the top 5 least corrupt countries in Europe. Most of them are the Northern European countries.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-215\" src=\"assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/fig_4.png\" alt=\"screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.28.37 pm\" /></p>\n<p>The above graph shows the top 5 least corrupt countries in Americas (both North and the South).</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-216\" src=\"assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/fig_5.png\" alt=\"screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.28.47 pm\" /></p>\n<p>The above graph shows the top 5 least corrupt countries in Middle East and North Africa.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-217\" src=\"assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/fig_6.png\" alt=\"screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.28.58 pm\" /></p>\n<p>The above graph shows the top 5 least corrupt countries in Sub-Saharan Africa.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-218\" src=\"assets/posts/political-corruption-throughout-the-world/fig_7.png\" alt=\"screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.34.15 pm\" /></p>\n<p>The above graph shows the top 5 least corrupt countries in Asia Pacific.</p>\n<p>These are very brief pictures of corruption throughout the world, divided by different regions of the world. Although these measures cannot solely be used to judge whether one country is politically more sophisticated and better to do business, it can explain which countries are the least corrupt ones according to a reliable organization. My home country Korea did not appear in the list. I wish to see Korea up there soon!</p>",
    "clean_title_en": "Political Corruption & Macroeconomic Development",
